    "innovation": "This paper constrains the strength of the terrestrial CO2 fertilization effect in the Canadian Earth System Model 4.2 by comparing simulations against four observation-based determinants of the global carbon cycle to identify the optimal model parameterization that best reproduces the historical carbon budget.",
